                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d22986cf-0de2-4b06-acd2-023729f8e755",
                                "sense_id": "93adc592-6de1-351c-aef8-0f5e7c0d41ce",
                                "text": "The coral-reef species of corals are the following.— 1. In the Astræa tribe (Astræacea), all the many known species. […] 6. Among Hydroids, the Millepores and Heliopores."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb80f2ff-7625-4659-8c0f-fe1b8dae5365",
                                "sense_id": "93adc592-6de1-351c-aef8-0f5e7c0d41ce",
                                "text": "The Heliolites are closely related to the Helioporæ, but the interstices are irregularly cellular[…] The cells contain twelve short rays or striations, and around the aperture twelve granules may generally be distinguished, situated like those of the Heliopores."
                            }
